OL,3,CMike Nesbitt resigns as Health Minister
OL,5,FMike Nesbitt has resigned as
OL,6,FStormont's Health Minister, the Ulster
OL,7,FUnionist Party (UUP) has confirmed.
OL,9,FA UUP spokesperson said they will
OL,10,Fcomment on further steps shortly.
OL,12,F"We can confirm that Mike Nesbitt has
OL,13,Fchosen to resign as Minister of
OL,14,FHealth, and we thank him sincerely for
OL,15,Fhis service and for the leadership he
OL,16,Fhas given to our health and social
OL,17,Fcare workforce," they said.
OL,26,@tD@AOUyD@PO]
