OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1787089698
OL,3,CMike Nesbitt resigns as Health Minister
OL,5,F"Mike took on one of the most
OL,6,Fdifficult briefs in government with a
OL,7,Fgenuine determination to make health
OL,8,Fand social care better for everyone in
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,11,F"From beginning the shift towards a
OL,12,Fneighbourhood model of care to putting
OL,13,Fhealth inequalities at the centre of
OL,14,Fpolicy, he leaves a significant
OL,15,Flegacy, not least the progress made on
OL,16,Fsome of Northern Ireland's longest
OL,17,Fwaiting lists.
OL,19,F"The Ulster Unionist Party will set
OL,20,Fout further details on next steps
OL,21,Fshortly."
OL,26,@mD@AOUsD@AOU{D@AOU}D@IO]
